claim.claim-text:
determining 101, a transmission length or format of a uplink control channel, PUCCH, in a slot;
determining 102, a transmission structure of the PUCCH on the basis of the transmission length or the format; and
transmitting 103, the PUCCH in the slot according to the transmission structure;
wherein determining a transmission structure of the PUCCH on the basis of the transmission length or the format comprises at least one of followings:

a first determining module (201) configured to determine a transmission length or format of a uplink control channel, PUCCH, in a slot;
a second determining module (202) configured to determine a transmission structure of the PUCCH on the basis of the transmission length or format; and
a transmission module (203) configured to transmit the PUCCH in the slot according to the transmission structure;
wherein determining a transmission structure of the PUCCH on the basis of the transmission length or the format comprises at least one of followings:
